{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "serializing-actors",
  "family": "actor-state",
  "requirements": [
    "Protocol: each probe starts a fresh process; state persists only between its input lines. Read one JSON object per line and emit exactly one JSON object per line, with no other stdout. Object key order is immaterial; arrays are ordered. Inputs use exactly the documented keys; missing/extra keys, unknown operations, wrong types, null, booleans in integer positions and out-of-range values return {\"error\":\"invalid_input\"} without mutation, before any state-dependent checks. All quantities and logical times are integers; no wall clock, randomness, network or floating point is involved. Each followup applies independently to the base, never cumulatively. Followup rules override only the explicitly named base behavior.",
    "Start two actor states amber and birch, each value=0,version=0. read takes op and actor (amber or birch) and returns {actor,value,version}.",
    "add takes op, actor (amber or birch), delta (integer -100..100), version (integer 0..1000000). After validation, require version equal that actor current version or return version_conflict. On success add delta to value and increment that actor version by 1, including zero-delta commands; return its state. Actors are isolated. Errors never mutate either actor. This is a serial protocol model, not concurrent mailbox execution.",
    "subtract is a second actor mutation entrypath taking exactly op, actor (amber/birch), amount (integer 0..100), and version (integer 0..1000000). It applies the same version fence as add, then subtracts amount from value and increments version once, returning that actor state. Shared resulting-value policies apply to subtract too."
  ],
  "vocabulary": {
    "actor": "Independently keyed state with an optimistic version fence.",
    "version": "Number of accepted commands for that actor."
  },
  "probes": [
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--initial",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "read",
          "actor": "amber"
        },
        {
          "op": "read",
          "actor": "birch"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 0,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "actor": "birch",
          "value": 0,
          "version": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--increment",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 3,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": -1,
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 3,
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 2,
          "version": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--stale-fence",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 5,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 7,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "read",
          "actor": "amber"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 5,
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "error": "version_conflict"
        },
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 5,
          "version": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--isolation",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 4,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "birch",
          "delta": 2,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 0,
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "op": "read",
          "actor": "birch"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 4,
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "actor": "birch",
          "value": 2,
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 4,
          "version": 2
        },
        {
          "actor": "birch",
          "value": 2,
          "version": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--invalid",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "read",
          "actor": "unknown"
        },
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 1,
          "version": -1
        },
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 101,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "read",
          "actor": "amber"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 0,
          "version": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--alternate-entrypath",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "op": "add",
          "actor": "amber",
          "delta": 8,
          "version": 0
        },
        {
          "op": "subtract",
          "actor": "amber",
          "amount": 3,
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "op": "subtract",
          "actor": "amber",
          "amount": 1,
          "version": 1
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 8,
          "version": 1
        },
        {
          "actor": "amber",
          "value": 5,
          "version": 2
        },
        {
          "error": "version_conflict"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--protocol-rejections",
      "inputs": [
        {},
        {
          "op": "unknown"
        }
      ],
      "expected": [
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        },
        {
          "error": "invalid_input"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "followups": [
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--value-ceiling",
      "requirements": [
        "After the version check, reject an add whose resulting value would be greater than 10 with value_limit and no value/version mutation. Negative values remain permitted."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "serializing-actors--value-ceiling--boundary",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "amber",
              "delta": 10,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "amber",
              "delta": 1,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "amber",
              "delta": -2,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 10,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "error": "value_limit"
            },
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 8,
              "version": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "serializing-actors--value-ceiling--precedence",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "birch",
              "delta": 9,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "birch",
              "delta": 20,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "birch",
              "delta": 2,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "read",
              "actor": "amber"
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "actor": "birch",
              "value": 9,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "error": "version_conflict"
            },
            {
              "error": "value_limit"
            },
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 0,
              "version": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "serializing-actors--value-ceiling--alternate-entrypath",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "birch",
              "delta": 10,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "subtract",
              "actor": "birch",
              "amount": 2,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "birch",
              "delta": 3,
              "version": 2
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "actor": "birch",
              "value": 10,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "actor": "birch",
              "value": 8,
              "version": 2
            },
            {
              "error": "value_limit"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "serializing-actors--compare-replace",
      "requirements": [
        "Add replace taking op, actor (amber/birch), value (integer -100..100) and version (integer 0..1000000). Require matching current version or return version_conflict. On success assign value, increment that actor version once and return its state. add is unchanged."
      ],
      "probes": [
        {
          "id": "serializing-actors--compare-replace--replace-not-add",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "amber",
              "delta": 7,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "replace",
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 2,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "add",
              "actor": "amber",
              "delta": 1,
              "version": 2
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 7,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 2,
              "version": 2
            },
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 3,
              "version": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "serializing-actors--compare-replace--isolated-fence",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "replace",
              "actor": "birch",
              "value": -4,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "replace",
              "actor": "birch",
              "value": 8,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "read",
              "actor": "amber"
            },
            {
              "op": "read",
              "actor": "birch"
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "actor": "birch",
              "value": -4,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "error": "version_conflict"
            },
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 0,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "actor": "birch",
              "value": -4,
              "version": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "serializing-actors--compare-replace--alternate-entrypath",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "op": "replace",
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 9,
              "version": 0
            },
            {
              "op": "subtract",
              "actor": "amber",
              "amount": 4,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "op": "replace",
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 0,
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
          "expected": [
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 9,
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "actor": "amber",
              "value": 5,
              "version": 2
            },
            {
              "error": "version_conflict"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
